<textArea id="m3458764685962793117" data-miro-id="3458764685962793117" x="600" y="1888" width="2520" height="47" fill="#595959" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" text-align="left">Provider callbacks: verified at the API and durably stored before acknowledgement. Scheduler handles expiry and reconciliation.</textArea>
